  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till MSFs projekt i Lubutu resp. Ituri. DRC teamet finansierar tillsammans HUMteam MSFs humantir&#xE4;ra progr2010 och d&#xE5; s&#xE4;rskilt de 2 projekten i Lubutu/Ituri som b&#xE5;da &#xE4;r av transitionskarakt&#xE4;r. Lubutu: att bygga upp remiss-systemet och st&#xE4;rka prim&#xE4;rh&#xE4;lsov&#xE5;rden. Ituru: st&#xF6;d till Bon March&#xE9; sjukhuset d&#xE4;r H&#xE4;lsoministeriet fn deltar i en process som syftar till att st&#xE4;rka deras kapacitet att ta &#xF6;ver sjukhu</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to MSFs project in Lubutu and Ituri respectively. DRCteam co-finances MSF combined HUM programme 2010 and dvp funds specifically target the above mentioned projects as they are both of transitional caracter. Lubutu: medical referral system and PHC support. Ituri: support to Bon March&#xE9; Hospital where MoH currently in the process of acquiring capacity to take over the activity.</narrative>
  </description>
